{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0db8da67c4e0828d1f7adbb1dce00d3d2ed15cc23473b75c7bb8cfbdb40b8dbb", "ja": "（今日は風花の宣材写真撮影だ。風花は、正統派\nアイドルっぽい写真にしたいと意気込んでいたが……）", "zh": "（今天风花来拍宣传照。\n她卯足干劲想要拍出正统派偶像的照片，然而……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1001_camman", "source_sha256": "0f6a0be9b958c90de868d91bd22ee6761e54322c28e4038efe7385c872878ecd", "ja": "うーん、どれもいい表情なんですが……。\nすみません、ちょっと待っていてもらえますか？", "zh": "嗯──每个表情都很棒没错……\n但是不好意思，可以请你稍等一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aff051e31bc4bbbff16e4330800755f60852c136e3b7d5797fcdd18c8ea90323", "ja": "は、はい！　わかりました！", "zh": "好、好的！我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9b84aaa6f913e6ba15cadd86e1ff5c135be0b307333b987bb7e63728ebae2d66", "ja": "（カメラマンさんも、悩んでるみたいだな。\n確かに、可愛いポーズもいいんだけど……）", "zh": "（摄影师似乎也很伤脑筋。\n虽说风花摆的可爱姿势的确很棒……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0c07208e7e45bb87c48ddd3c34bde2d82fb164f7ce36c2f70e76388dbf741a5b", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\n私、何か間違ってましたか……？", "zh": "不好意思，{$P$}先生。\n请问我做错什么事了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "04022bf7ee52531183df246aa22bf3f61a0ffa47efe0d8102d69756833129b55", "ja": "正統派アイドルっぽくなるように、\nにこやかな笑顔を心がけてみたんですけど……。", "zh": "为了看起来能像个正统派偶像，\n我有试着提醒自己摆出柔和的笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "357dfdc66685ccda5d15d971319794c29214a8a9e077e046d515828ba498b2ad", "ja": "う～ん、間違ってはいないんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯～你并没有做错什么，但……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1007_camman", "source_sha256": "550ec892369c632fd6ce8bc343ae4a0e924695dc1ded85a6fe2c1efdc672ca4d", "ja": "風花さん、色々考えてみたんですけど。", "zh": "风花小姐，我刚才思考了一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "74f5c3c7c10c57771fd2a8a435be5b388e6ddd6693feb8a793fdd47bb012db32", "ja": "は、はいっ！", "zh": "是、是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1009_camman", "source_sha256": "eda81d406155866a1a222a796a3e7489f39016bc7e0ea48e5c470dd656a38618", "ja": "後半は、少し大胆なポーズで撮ってみるのは\nどうでしょう？　セクシーな感じで……。", "zh": "后半部分，要不要拍些稍微大胆一点的姿势呢？\n走性感路线……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1fe53d703b4fe9b155ff1791bc937d8dd588b3d41922103664e7b047a1cb8f8d", "ja": "大胆な……せ、セクシーポーズですか！？\nそんなの無理ですよ～！", "zh": "大胆……性、性感的姿势吗！？\n我办不到啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a0500df50ea3340b43e03ec03e24e08a3b6625d151447e4a290d3f3b91a62c9f", "ja": "いいんじゃないか？　風花なら……いや、\n風花だからこそ、できるんじゃないかと思う！", "zh": "我觉得很不错啊。我相信如果是风花……不，\n正因为是风花，所以才办得到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6442d725d34e3b07bc2869bbf202c69870a9763acfd6784919956511d8b717be", "ja": "えぇっ！？　そ、そんなぁ……。", "zh": "什么！？你、你怎么这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1233d7a1264930aafe966425bf05baeecbc31465cfca479bf500c6aba801e6f3", "ja": "うぅ……でも、\n{$P$}さんがそう言うなら……。", "zh": "呜呜……不过，\n既然{$P$}先生这么坚持……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9c96885729e3b88c0eeb18d032efcf85b0e28265b72091c9c9006c7bd8e4fc47", "ja": "わかりました。\nは、初めてですけど……頑張ります！", "zh": "我明白了。\n虽、虽然是第一次尝试……但我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "dc428c196e5c732477a67e11781014df80c86f48f1240d052c9f9dbbd9d64dab", "ja": "ああ、頑張ろう！\nじゃあカメラマンさん、後はよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好，加油吧！\n那么摄影师，接下来就麻烦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "04ec7a84adcb7a1890f2143eb5add466090ff9bcc451e55cbec209f8ec8c53bd", "ja": "前に屈んで、胸をぎゅっとして……\nえっ！？　お、お尻を突き出すんですかぁ！？", "zh": "向前弯腰，胸口用力挤……\n什么！？臀、臀部要翘起来吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1017_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cd722c83eafc84ad1436cbbf69bf43cfbdd62e8337bf0368effb42549036e236", "ja": "お疲れさま、風花！\n後半の撮影、すごくよかったぞ！", "zh": "辛苦你了，风花！\n后半部分拍得很棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5911ec4c34433b59eeb9f2cab2efa0aca129e13bfcd76acce071dfc9fcfa1335", "ja": "うぅ……あ、あんな恥ずかしいポーズをとるなんて、\nすごく緊張しました……。", "zh": "呜呜……居、居然摆出那么难为情的姿势，\n我好紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b8f11aea53240624e110240d475d6b99d8a7040e8f0c4b1e7c099ab1d9970270", "ja": "そんなに肩を落とさなくても……最後にもう一回、\n正統派のポーズも撮ってもらえたじゃないか。", "zh": "你也不用这么沮丧吧……\n最后不是有用正统派的姿势再拍一次了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "85c7d72562129278431bf531cc0ca2b29f72243ffdd1875ea386048e8069833a", "ja": "はい！\nあの時間は、とっても幸せでした……♪", "zh": "是啊！\n那段时光真的好幸福……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1022_p", "source_sha256": "774aad0c9571c2f4bf5272aa9e6ddaf0ab57d7c68caf3fd5e1547f0bca73a67a", "ja": "でも、今日の撮影でわかったけど……\n風花は、セクシー路線でもいけそうだな！", "zh": "不过，今天的拍摄让我确定了一件事……\n风花要走性感路线也毫无问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0acc4eded61e4f462636e9ec53a2b08016b53ce6c845dd457deeedad306b5879", "ja": "え……。{$P$}さんっ！？\nま、待ってください！？", "zh": "咦……{$P$}先生！？\n请、请你等一下！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6178c4ae298cf9d9fdf8c0e971931335f3c361ca6c92de755ff522100cf9ed49", "ja": "私は、正統派アイドルになりたいんですってば～！", "zh": "我想当的是正统派偶像啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c842cf7e477cbf7743dbdc44079581c24803fd8186762f7e61bb53b31c27b59b", "ja": "まあ、アイドルにもいろんな仕事や\n可能性があるから……。", "zh": "别这么说嘛，偶像本来就要做各种工作，\n拥有许多不同的可能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_041fuk_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_041fuk_002_1026_p", "source_sha256": "1114894c69bb3f7b55f78b1541b0de44513e8aeca6efb98dac7658729ae47714", "ja": "（それに、セクシー路線と並行してこそ、\n正統派のイメージも引き立つ……はずだ！）", "zh": "（而且，和性感路线双管齐下，\n更能衬托出正统派的形象……应该吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
